hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, kehne lagay: Jibreel Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithe thay, unhone apne oopar se ek aawaz suni, toh unhone apna sar uthaya aur farmaya: Yeh aasman ka ek darwaza hai jo aaj kholha gaya hai, isse pehle kabhi nahi khula. Phir usme se ek farishta nazil hua, toh farmaya: Yeh ek aisa farishta hai jo zameen par utra hai, isse pehle kabhi nahi utra. Usne salam kiya aur farmaya: Do nooron ki basharat do jinhein tumhein ata kiya gaya hai, tum se pehle kisi nabi ko nahi diye gaye: Fatihatul Kitab aur Surah Al-Baqarah ki khawateem. Tum in mein se koi harf parhoge toh woh tumhein ata kiya jayega."
"5","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin Al-Samit se riwayat hai, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak pahunchi hai: Jis shakhs ne Fatihatul Kitab nahi parhi, uski namaz nahi."
"6","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jisne aisi namaz parhi jis mein Ummul Qur'an nahi parhi, toh woh khaaj hai - teen maratib - ghair tamam. Abu Hurairah se kaha gaya: Hum imam ke peeche hote hain. Unhone kaha: Apne zaan mein parho, kyunke maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna hai: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Maine namaz ko apne aur apne bande ke darmiyan do aadhe hisson mein taqseem kiya hai, aur mere bande ke liye wahi hai jo woh maange. Toh jab bande kahe (Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Aalameen), Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri hamd ki. Aur jab kahe (Ar-Rahmanir-Raheem), Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri sifat ki. Aur jab kahe (Maliki Yaumid Deen), farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri azmat ki - aur ek riwayat mein farmaya: Mere bande ne mujhe mukhtiyar maana. Aur jab bande kahe (Iyyaka na'budu wa iyyaka nasta'een), farmata hai: Yeh mere aur mere bande ke darmiyan hai aur mere bande ke liye wahi hai jo woh maange. Phir jab bande kahe (Ihdinas Siratal Mustaqeem, Siratal latheena an'amta alaihim ghairil maghdoobi alaihim wa la ad-dalleen), farmata hai: Yeh mere bande ke liye hai aur mere bande ke liye wahi hai jo woh maange."
"20","[AI-translation] Yaqeenan Safa aur Marwah Allah ki sha'air mein se hain, toh jis cheez se Allah ne shuru kiya hai, tum bhi usse shuru karo."
